  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Fixes a SheryDragList card that did not render after a drop, and a move being applied twice when both MoveRequested and MoveRequestedCommand are wired (set the new SheryDragListMoveEventArgs.Handled to opt out of the command). A SheryDragList column now shows its Title, which was drawn in the same colour as the column behind it and so was invisible in both palettes. SheryDataTable no longer starts a fetch while it is off the visual tree, including from a debounced search whose delay expires after a navigation. Adds accessible names and roles to SheryComboBox and both date pickers, and Windows keyboard reachability to SheryDatePicker and SheryPersianDatePicker (open and close; choosing a date still needs a pointer). Full notes in CHANGELOG.md.",
